      <!--

    ************************ PointViewer ************************

    A lone Point has no path and no bounds, so the Geometry viewer draws nothing for it. This one
    draws a filled dot (any radius: LayerViewer fits it to the widget). Registered after the
    Geometry viewer; the editor picks the viewer registered for the most specific type.
-->
